/*⁣‌‍​⁠‍​‍​​​⁠⁠‌​‍⁠‌‍‍‌‌​​‍⁠‌⁠​​⁠⁠​‌‌‍​‍​‌‍‍‍‍‍​‍‌‌‌⁠‌‍⁠⁠​⁠⁠‍​⁠‌‍⁠‌⁣⁣‌‍⁠​⁠‌‌‍‌‍⁠‍⁠‌​⁠‌‍‍⁠​‌⁠‍​​‌‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‌‍‌‍‌⁠⁠⁠‌⁠‌‌‌⁠⁠‌‌‍‌⁠‌​​​‍⁣⁣‌‍⁠​⁠‌‌‍‌‍⁠‍⁠‌​⁠‌‍‍⁠​‌⁠‍​​‌‍‌‌⁠‍‍⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‌‍‌‍‌⁠⁠⁠‌⁠‌‌‌⁠⁠‌‌‍‌⁠‌​​​‍⁣ =========================================================
   Theme: Lingo｜类iMessage美化by烧酒酒
   自动跟随系统设置日夜无缝切换🈲二传🈲除调适配外的二改
   📌X无蚂蚁线翻译字体
 ========================================================= */

/* ---------------------------------------------------------
   ☀️【日间模式变量 (Light Mode Default)】
   --------------------------------------------------------- */
:root {
  /* 1. 顶栏悬浮卡片控制 */
  --header-card-height: 76px;
  --header-card-top-offset: 0px;
  --header-back-btn-left: 0px;
  --header-back-arrow-x: 11px;
  --header-title-size: 20px;
  --header-title-y: -8px;
  --header-avatar-size: 29px;
  --header-avatar-left-offset: 98px;
  --header-subtitle-gap: 16px;

  /* 2. 底栏控制 */
  --slider-arrow-size: 21px;

  /* 3. 气泡与列表控制 */
  --bubble-font-size: 15px;
  --bubble-padding: 7px 15px;
  --bubble-gap-same: 2px;
  --bubble-gap-diff: 17px;
  --list-bottom-clearance: 110px;

  /* 4. 日间色彩规范 */
  --chat-bg-color: #f7f7f8;
  --bubble-me-bg: #007aff;
  --bubble-me-color: #ffffff;
  --bubble-them-bg: #e6e6ea;
  --bubble-them-color: #000000;
  --bubble-them-border: none;           /* 去除描边 */
  --text-main: #111111;
  --text-sub: #8e8e93;

  /* 5. 日间统一玻璃引擎 */
  --ios-glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  --ios-glass-blur: blur(24px) saturate(175%);
  --ios-glass-border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  --ios-glass-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 1.2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85),
    0 8px 26px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),
    0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);

  /* 6. 特殊部件日间色 */
  --card-bg: #ffffff;
  --card-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  --btn-back-bg: #f2f2f7;
  --knob-holder-bg: #e8e8ed;
  --knob-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  --knob-dark: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);

  /* 滑块按键背景与弹出面板 */
  --slider-btn-bg: #ffffff;
  --slider-btn-border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  --more-options-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
  --more-options-color: #111111;
  --more-options-divider: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);

  /* 其它功能开关 */
  --typing-bg: transparent;
  --typing-dot-color: #8e8e93;
  --typing-dot-size: 7px;
  --reply-detached-name-suffix: "";

  /*【新增】翻译字幕上下间距控制 */
  --translation-top-gap: -10px;        /* 翻译距离上方气泡的距离 (负数贴近，正数拉开) */
  --translation-bottom-gap: 4px;       /* 翻译距离下方下一条气泡的距离 (越大越远) */

}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------
   🌙【夜间模式变量 (Dark Mode Overrides)】
   跟随系统 prefers-color-scheme 自动触发
   --------------------------------------------------------- */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root, body, .chat-detail-screen {
    --chat-bg-color: #000000 !important;
    --bubble-me-bg: #0a84ff !important;
    --bubble-me-color: #ffffff !important;
    --bubble-them-bg: #262629 !important;
    --bubble-them-color: #f5f5f7 !important;
    --bubble-them-border: none !important; /* 👈 夜间绝不要白描边 */
    --text-main: #f5f5f7 !important;
    --text-sub: #98989d !important;

    /* 暗夜高质感液态玻璃 */
    --ios-glass-bg: rgba(28, 28, 30, 0.7) !important;
    --ios-glass-blur: blur(30px) saturate(190%) !important;
    --ios-glass-border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) !important;
    --ios-glass-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18),
      0 12px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) !important;

    --card-bg: #1c1c1e !important;
    --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) !important;
    --btn-back-bg: #1c1c1e !important;
    --knob-holder-bg: #1e1e20 !important;
    --knob-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important;
    --knob-dark: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;

    /* 👈 底栏滑块夜间质感 + 更多选项菜单暗夜玻璃 */
    --slider-btn-bg: #2c2c2e !important;
    --slider-btn-border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) !important;
    --more-options-bg: rgba(36, 36, 38, 0.85) !important;
    --more-options-color: #ffffff !important;
    --more-options-divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important;
  }

  /* 👇 就在这里！直接加在变量块后面、@media 结束的大括号前： */
  .input-box-custom {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;
    caret-color: #0a84ff !important; /* 顺手加个 iOS 亮蓝光标，打字更清晰 */
  }

}

/* =========================================================
   1. 隐藏全局头像 (放行顶栏头像，气泡旁头像保持隐藏)
   ========================================================= */
.msg-avatar-them-container,
.msg-avatar-me-container {
  display: none !important;
}
.msg-avatar-them-ghost {
  display: block !important;
}
.chat-header-custom .header-avatar-container {
  display: block !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   2. 消息滚动区：【真实穿透 + 顶底双端自然融化 + 底部呼吸避让】
   ========================================================= */
.chat-messages-area,
.chat-message-list-custom {
  padding-top: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 14px) + var(--header-card-height) + 12px) !important;
  padding-bottom: var(--list-bottom-clearance) !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;

  /* 👇 顶底双向渐变遮罩：顶部淡入 + 中间实色 + 底部在胶囊上方自然淡出 */
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    transparent 0px,
    black calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 20px) + 35px),
    black calc(100% - 90px),
    transparent calc(100% - 1px)
  ) !important;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    transparent 0px,
    black calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 20px) + 35px),
    black calc(100% - 90px),
    transparent calc(100% - 1px)
  ) !important;
}

.chat-detail-screen::before {
  display: none !important;
}

.msg-bubble-wrapper[data-absolute-last="true"],
.msg-bubble-wrapper:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 5px !important;
}

/* =========================================================
   2.1 【超细实心锁·单行 Encrypted 时间戳】
   ========================================================= */
.timestamp-custom {
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  text-align: center !important;
  color: var(--text-sub) !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  margin: 14px 0 8px 0 !important;
  line-height: 1.4 !important;
}

/* 绘制单行：超精准 6.5px × 8px 实心锁 + Encrypted */
.timestamp-custom::before {
  content: "Encrypted" !important;
  display: inline-flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
  font-weight: 500 !important;
  color: var(--text-sub, #8e8e93) !important;
  line-height: 1 !important;
  margin-bottom: 4px !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px !important;
  padding-left: 10.5px !important; /* 👈 匹配 6.5px 小锁的舒适留白 */

